# Keep images small and keep secrets/evidence/scripts out of them.
# Dockerfiles use `COPY . /app`, so anything in the repo folder is baked into the image
# (and pushed to ECR / Artifact Registry) unless listed here.
# NOTE: a pattern WITHOUT "**/" only matches at the top level of the folder.
.venv/
.venv*
evidence_*
experiments/results_rerun_*
.git/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.zip
**/*.db
lambda_build/
precheck_*/
evidence_*/
*.ps1
**/*_Console_Output*.txt
**/*.docx
**/*.pdf
**/partition_v*_log*.jsonl
egress_saved.json
sg_during_revoke.json
validation/data/